bazel-*
*.html
!testdata/**/*.html
# The GitHub Pages site is a committed artifact; //site:site_test keeps it
# fresh. Only the exact files the generator writes are un-ignored, so a stray
# preview written into docs/ stays invisible to git.
!docs/index.html
# demos/ nests since the sitegen rewrite: a subfolder of examples/ becomes a
# subfolder of demos/ with its own index.
!docs/demos/**/*.html
# The playground's page is a source file, not something a command emits: the
# site is assembled from it at deploy time and never committed.
!web/**/*.html
.DS_Store
dist/
# Tool droppings: the Playwright MCP server's session logs and its npm cache.
.playwright-mcp/
.npm/
# Repo-local GitHub identity, referenced by core.sshCommand. Never committed.
.ssh/
